      <p>Health Insurance (Pathology) (Fees) (Repeal) Act 2025</p>
      <p>No. 40, 2025</p>
      <p>An Act to repeal the <i>Health Insurance (Pathology) (Fees) Act 1991</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 4 September 2025</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
